  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can bend the laws of magic with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Unbounded Conversion<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You reduce the number of points you must have remaining in your ki pool to spontaneously cast a metamagic spell without increasing its casting time by an amount equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1). In addition, you can spend 1 point from your ki pool as a swift action when spontaneously casting a spell to increase that spell’s caster level by 1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc78\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
